                                                "sense_id": "dfa3282e-cf1b-3655-a31c-a4744fce09a9",
                                                "text": "“Yes, daddy,” I moaned, lying big-time as his finger played in my sudsy pussy. “Say please,” he ordered, taking my hand to circle around his gherkin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af57c386-ab4b-4e85-a367-1f8340d6ec77",
